---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | TRAKNOVA"
  description="How TRAKNOVA handles information submitted through this website and in the course of a business inquiry."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>
        <h1>Privacy<br /><em>Policy.</em></h1>
        <p>How we handle information submitted through this website and in the course of a business inquiry.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap legal">
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 5 November 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>This website is operated by TRAKNOVA. For questions about this policy or the information we hold, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit the inquiry form, we collect the information you provide: name, business email, company, country or region, product and application interest, cooperation interest, deployment timeline, estimated quantity and project details. If you contact us by email, WhatsApp or another channel, we receive the information you choose to send.</p>
        <p>Our form service may also process technical information necessary to deliver and protect the form, such as the time of submission and basic request metadata.</p>

        <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your inquiry and answer your questions</li>
          <li>To prepare a device shortlist, datasheet request or quotation</li>
          <li>To manage an ongoing commercial relationship</li>
          <li>To understand how the website is used and improve it</li>
          <li>To comply with legal, tax and record-keeping obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>
        <p>Where applicable law requires a legal basis, we process inquiry information because you have asked us to provide information or a quotation, because we have a legitimate interest in responding to business inquiries, and where necessary to comply with legal obligations.</p>

        <h2>5. Sharing</h2>
        <p>We use service providers for website hosting and form processing, including Formspree, and may share information with manufacturing, logistics or professional advisers where needed to respond to your request. We do not sell personal information.</p>

        <h2>6. Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain inquiry records for as long as needed to respond and maintain the business relationship, and afterwards for the period required by applicable law.</p>

        <h2>7. Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>This website does not currently use advertising or analytics cookies. If analytics or other tracking technologies are introduced, this policy will be updated and, where required, consent will be requested.</p>

        <h2>8. International transfers</h2>
        <p>Inquiry information may be processed in countries where our service providers operate. Where required, we use appropriate safeguards for those transfers.</p>

        <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or restrict the use of your personal information, or to object to processing. To exercise a right, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

        <h2>10. Security</h2>
        <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect inquiry information. No internet transmission is completely secure, so please avoid sending sensitive personal information through the inquiry form.</p>

        <h2>11. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows the latest revision.</p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
